      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's more up to the community than the devs. Most of the public avatars that you have immediate access to without it being on your favorites list are made by the community and not the devs. Unless some of them do make public avatars and I just don't know their user names. There are plenty of worlds for quest users to find avatars, though. If you still feel like that's not enough, just look into how to upload an avatar for quest users. Most of the community is on PC, so they either are too lazy to optimize their avatars for quest users or don't know how to. Hence why you'll find more avatars on PC.",
